@startuml
!include style.iuml
title Reservation request status (FR-15, D-05, D-06)
[*] --> Pending : Seeker submits request\n[listing has slots,\nno open request]
Pending --> Accepted : Owner accepts\n[availableSlots > 0]\n/ availableSlots − 1
Pending --> Rejected : Owner rejects\n/ slots unchanged
Pending --> [*] : Seeker withdraws\n/ request deleted
Pending --> [*] : Owner or admin deletes\nthe listing / cascade delete
Accepted --> [*] : Listing deleted
Rejected --> [*] : Listing deleted
note right of Accepted : Final — cannot be undone (D-06).\nOwner raises slots manually\nif the deal falls through.
note right of Rejected : Final. Seeker may submit\na new request later.
@enduml
